  "goodToKnow": "Das Manuskript is a manuscript, a text before publication: das Manuskript beim Verlag einreichen. It also means the notes or script for a speech or broadcast: frei sprechen, ohne Manuskript. Medieval manuscripts are also Handschriften. From Latin manu scriptum (written by hand). The Frankfurt Book Fair, the Frankfurter Buchmesse, is the world's largest trade fair for books. Plural: die Manuskripte."
